  "goodToKnow": "Freisprechen means to acquit: Der Angeklagte wurde freigesprochen, aus Mangel an Beweisen (for lack of evidence). Der Freispruch is an acquittal; the principle in dubio pro reo (when in doubt, for the accused) applies. In the crafts, apprentices are traditionally freigesprochen at the end of training in a ceremony (Freisprechungsfeier). Free speech is die Meinungsfreiheit. Separable: sprach frei, freigesprochen."
